// item in hand, the lore card, the status icons), and hudRects() adds what the HUD already kept (the panels in HUDBOX, the run goals and
// the gun card in EDGEBOX, the minimap, the feed rows, the belt cells, the teammate rows). hudRectOverlaps(rects) lists every pair that
